OL,3,GNEWSAHigh school evacuated over
OL,4,Amalicious communications
OL,5,
OL,6,FA secondary school was evacuated after
OL,7,Freports of malicious communications
OL,8,Fwere sent, police said.
OL,10,FSuffolk Police was called to Stoke High
OL,11,FSchool Ormiston Academy in Ipswich just
OL,12,Fafter 08:05 BST.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for the force said
OL,15,Fofficers attended the school site on
OL,16,FMaidenhall Approach to establish the
OL,17,Ffull circumstances of the incident.
OL,19,FAt about 12:00, they said staff and
OL,20,Fpupils had returned and there had been
OL,21,Fno arrests, but inquiries would
OL,22,Fcontinue.
